abstract: "Three open CSV datasets modeling 2026 US marketplace seller payouts across 8 platforms, eBay's effective Final Value Fee across all 50 US states plus DC due to sales-tax inclusion, and payment processing fees from $5 to $10,000 across Stripe, PayPal, and Square."
